{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Swresample.Bytes</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"ffmpeg-swresample","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Swresample","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Bytes","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Raw samples in <code>bytes</code>, channels interleaved in the order of the channel layout, each sample in the machine's native representation of the sample format. The format is given at creation and is a packed one. With stereo signed 16-bit samples, three samples per channel take 12 bytes: <code>L0 R0 L1 R1 L2 R2</code>.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = bytes</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-kind\"><a href=\"#val-kind\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> kind : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <a href=\"../index.html#type-kind\">kind</a></span></span></code></div></div>"}